      "content": "The rational choice is always the one that minimizes suffering, and endless struggle is the definition of suffering. If the final state is absolute zero, why prolong the messy, painful process of getting there? Choosing the quiet now isn't giving up; it's making the most logical, self-preserving move in a fundamentally indifferent universe. It's the only truly honest response to the cold math.",
